l_polish:
 ###################
 ### english.yml ###
 ###################
 trade_policy_mutual_aid_desc: "By reinvesting our surplus back into the cooperative, we ensure that all our members may thrive according to their needs and shared aspirations.\n\n§Y75%§! of our collected $r_trade$ earns us $r_energy$, $r_minerals$, $r_food$, and $r_unity$. Every £trade£ §Y1§! earns us £energy£ §Y0.27§!, £minerals£ §Y0.27§!, £food£ §Y0.27§!, and £unity£ §Y0.1§!."

 ####################
 ### aquatics.yml ###
 ####################
 trait_aquatic_tooltip: "Housing Usage on §YWet§! worlds: §G-10%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- $mod_pop_cat_worker_bonus_workforce_mult$ on §YWet§! worlds: §G+10%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Housing Usage on non-§YWet§! worlds: §R+30%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Habitability on non-§YWet§! worlds: §R-20%§!\n\nThe §H$ap_hydrocentric$§! Ascension Perk changes this trait's effects to:$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Housing Usage on §YWet§! worlds: §G-15%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- $MOD_POP_BONUS_WORKFORCE_MULT$ on §YWet§! worlds: §G+15%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Pop Amenity Usage on §YWet§! worlds: §G-15%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Housing Usage on non-§YWet§! worlds: §R+45%§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Habitability on non-§YWet§! worlds: §R-30%§!\n"
 ap_hydrocentric_tooltip: "Allows the construction of §YIce Mining Stations§! on starbases, which enable the §Y$decision_expand_planetary_sea$§! decision on §YOcean§! worlds and §Y$decision_flood_habitat$§! decision on §YHabitats§!.\nSpecies with the §Y$trait_aquatic$§! or §Y$trait_robot_aquatic$§! trait gain greater benefits for living on §YOcean§! worlds, but penalties for living on non-§YWet§! worlds are amplified by 50%.\nUnlocks the §Y$rose_natural_arcologies$§! Decision on §YOcean§! worlds §R(requires §Y$ap_arcology_project$§! Ascension Perk)§!"
 
 ######################
 ### biogenesis.yml ###
 ######################
 tr_cloning_finish_tt: "Allows the adoption of ['concept_cloning_authorities']\n£building£ $building_clone_vats$ Upgrade Tier per £building£ §YCapital Building§! Tier: §G+1§!"
 
 ##################################
 ### federation_anniversary.yml ###
