 habitat_system_tt: "§EHabitat Potential:§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Maximum Districts: §Y[root.GetHabitatMaxDistricts]§!$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- £energy£: §Y[root.HabitatTooltipEnergyDistrictMax]§! | £minerals£: §Y[root.HabitatTooltipMiningDistrictMax]§! | £research£: §Y[root.HabitatTooltipScienceDistrictMax]§!"
 
 #######################
 ### federations.yml ###
 #######################
 make_spiritualist_1_effect: "Non-spiritualist non-gestalt empires have §YBureaucratic§! buildings swapped for §YTemples§!.\nSpiritualist empires gain §G+1§! £unity£ §YUnity§! from £job_priest£ §Y$job_priest_plural$§!.\nAll empires gain §G+10%§! faster organic pop growth and §G+5%§! faster robotic pop assembly."
 
 #####################
 ### infernals.yml ###
 #####################
 civic_world_forgers_effects: "- Unlocks starting planet: ['concept_pc_volcanic']. \n- $GUARANTEED_RESEARCH_OPTION_STRING$ £society_research£ ['concept_volcanic_forge']. \n- Can construct £building£ §Y$building_volcanic_forge_1$§! building which adds £job_polytechnic_mentor£ ['concept_polytechnic_mentor']. \n- Planets with a £building£ §Y$building_volcanic_forge_1$§! will gradually turn into a §Y$pc_volcanic$§!. \n- ['concept_guaranteed_colonies'] will be §Y$climate_dry$§! worlds. \n- Unlocks the §Y$rose_natural_arcologies$§! Decision on §Y$pc_volcanic_plural$§! §R(requires §Y$ap_arcology_project$§! Ascension Perk)§!""
 
 #######################
 ### machine_age.yml ###
 #######################
 tr_nanotech_finish_modifier_desc: "§YUnlocks Ship:§! Nanite Interdictor\n§YUnlocks Army:§! Nanite Swarm\n§Y$sm_nanite_harvester_plural$§! yield improvements every §Y5§! years, either increasing the size of $r_nanites$ deposits or yielding a sum of nanites. This effect is limited by the size of the planet that deposits are created upon.\nAll §Y$trait_machine_unit$§! pops and leaders gain §Y$leader_trait_rose_nanotech$§!"
 
 ###################
 ### main_2.yml ####
 ###################
 civic_tooltip_environmentalist_effects: "$t$- $AVAILABLE_BUILDINGS$ £building£ ['building:building_ranger_lodge']$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- $ADDITIONAL_BUILDINGS_STRING$ £building£ §Y$building_ranger_lodge$§!\n$t$- $AVAILABLE_HOLDINGS$ £building£ ['building:holding_park_ranger_lodge']$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- Unlocks the §Y$rose_natural_arcologies$§! Decision on all natural worlds §R(requires §Y$ap_arcology_project$§! Ascension Perk)§!"
 
 #####################
 ### paragon_3.yml ###
 #####################
 paragon.5202.regular: "The news didn't take long to spread among the population; §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]§! is dying. While the cause of this mysterious illness remains unknown, it does not appear to be immediately terminal.\n\nFor now, §Y[Ruler.GetRegnalName]§! can remain at [Ruler.GetHerHis] post. However, unorthodox methods will be necessary to extend our leader's life by any significant amount of time."
 paragon.5202.synth: "The news didn't take long to spread among the population; §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]'s§! neural net is failing. While the cause of this mysterious error has eluded our best minds, it is not immediately terminal.\n\nFor now, §Y[Ruler.GetRegnalName]§! can remain at [Ruler.GetHerHis] post. However, unorthodox methods will be necessary to repair and extend [Ruler.GetHerHis] functionality by any significant amount of time."
 paragon.5202.b: "Grant [Ruler.GetRegnalName] the rest [Ruler.GetSheHe] deserves."
 paragon.6000.desc.ap_mind_over_matter: "$paragon.6000.desc$\n\nOur [GetPsychicNounPlural] have also devised a plan. By harnessing the collective [GetSorrow] of our people, the myriad energies of the Shroud could be manipulated to [GetRejuvenate] our fallen leader. For a price, §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]§! can be kept alive indefinitely."
 paragon.6000.desc.ap_synthetic_evolution: "Our roboticists have a suggestion to repair §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]§!: while expensive, we can move [Ruler.GetHerHis] mind into a new, self-correcting, positronic network. This would give [Ruler.GetHerHis] the ability to network with the entire population, improving [Ruler.GetHerHis] already considerable skills."
 paragon.6015.desc_1: "Our work was a success. By invoking the power of the §HShroud§!, §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]§! has been saved. With unprecedented levels of psionic energies coursing through [Ruler.GetHimHer], [Ruler.GetHeShe] has achieved immortality."
 paragon.6015.desc_2.organic: "However, the ordeal has left [Ruler.GetHimHer] subtly changed...those close to [Ruler.GetHimHer] whisper of [Ruler.GetHimHer] being regularly distracted, as if talking with invisible advisors and detractors. It appears the Shroud's energies are keeping the Luminary alive at a steeper, more corrosive cost than initially expected."
 paragon.6020.desc: "Success! §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]§!'s consciousness has been transferred to a new synthetic frame. Quantum processing allows [Ruler.GetHimHer] instantaneous networking with every synthetic unit.\n\nThis powerful meta-awareness has begun to change [Ruler.GetHerHis] point of view. Now, [Ruler.GetRegnalName] is focused on macro processing patterns, aiming to improve the overall efficiency of our civilization."
 paragon.6035.desc: "Marking the end of the recent tumultuous events, a grand celebration was held on [capital_scope.GetName]. §Y[Ruler.GetTitle] [Ruler.GetRegnalName]§! gave a speech thanking citizens and scientists, and spoke of the bright and prosperous future [Ruler.GetSheHe] has planned for the §Y[Owner.GetName]§!."
 paragon.6035.b.tt2: "§Y[Owner.GetName]§! shifts its ethics towards §Y$ethic_egalitarian$§!\n"
 paragon.6035.c: "Our people have earned some freedom."
 paragon.6035.c.tt: "The government will be reformed. The $leader_trait_legendary_leader$ will continue to support and guide us, but now the people will have a say in their government."
 leader_trait_the_psionic_luminary: "Shroudbound"
 leader_trait_the_psionic_luminary_desc: "By opening a permanent link to the Shroud in this leader's mind, they have become a fixed point in both worlds. This unique dual perspective allows them to manage the population more efficiently and securely." 
 
 ###################
 ### paragon.yml ###
 ###################
 council_agenda_agenda_leadership_conditioning_effect: "§Y$@agenda_leadership_conditioning_exp_reward|0$§! Experience will be shared between all §YLeaders§! below §YSkill Level 10§! and all negative traits will be removed from a random council member"
 
 #####################
 ### plantoids.yml ###
 #####################
 civic_tooltip_idyllic_bloom_effects: "Can build £building£ §Y$building_gaiaseeders$§! on your and your vassal's worlds ideal to your starting species.\n$building_gaiaseeders_all_desc$\nAs you unlock improved £society£ §YTerraforming§! technologies, £building£ §Y$building_gaiaseeders$§! can be constructed on additional planet types.\nAdds the §H$trait_plantoid_bloomed$§! trait."
 
 ###################
 ### shroud.yml ####
 ###################
 civic_secret_societies_effects: "Clandestine ['concept_ss_factions'] will emerge after contacting other empires.\nStarts with the ability to conduct ['concept_proxy_wars'].\n$job_bureaucrat_plural_with_icon$ will produce $i_unity$ per started §YProxy War§!.\nStarts in ['concept_first_contact'] with two neighboring empires.\n$INFILTRATION_LEVEL$ gained on empires after §Y$first_contact$§!: §G+$@secret_society_infiltration_gain|0$§!"
 secret_societies_proxy_war_bonus_tt: "[GetBureaucratPluralWithIcon] produces §G+$@secret_societies_unity_per_proxy_war|1$§! $i_unity$ per started §HProxy War§!."
 
 ######################
 ### traditions.yml ###
 ######################
 tr_mercantile_worker_coop_improved_ownership_desc: "Additional §Y$living_standard_worker_ownership$§! Living Standard Effects:$TABBED_NEW_LINE$- £happiness£ Happiness: §G+5%§! $TABBED_NEW_LINE$- £mod_pop_bonus_workforce_mult£ $mod_organic_pop_bonus_workforce_mult$: §G+5%§!\n\nUnlocks §Y$trade_policy_mutual_aid_minerals$§! and §Y$trade_policy_mutual_aid_food$§! §YTrade Policies§!, which allow us to focus on converting our £trade_value£ §YTrade Value§! into £minerals£ §YMinerals§! or £food£ §YFood§!."
 tr_harmony_federations_finish_desc: "$MOD_PLANETARY_ASCENSION_EFFECT_MULT$: §G+20%§!.\nGrants access to the §Y$spiritualist_federation$§! Federation type.\nAscension Perks Unlocked: §G+1§!"
 tr_synchronicity_machine_finish_desc: "§YUnlocks Edict:§! $edict_industrial_maintenance$.\n$MOD_PLANETARY_ASCENSION_EFFECT_MULT$: §G+20%§!\nAscension Perks Unlocked: §G+1§!"